WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.160
What the hell is this?

3
00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.580
I thought we trapped the lightning one!

4
00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:20.540
You've got some nerve...

5
00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:24.840
to do this to me, Kid!

6
00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:27.130
I'll see to it...

7
00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:31.180
that you're severely punished
for dropping me into the sea!

8
00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:33.430
Prepare yourself.

9
00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:38.140
What should we do?

10
00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:40.310
This ain't lookin' good for us.

11
00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:42.230
Old hag's got some spunk.

12
00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:43.270
Not only that...

13
00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:45.730
she seems a helluva lot more powerful!

14
00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:50.150
Crap...

15
00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:51.700
We'd better...

16
00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:53.490
get outta here!

17
00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:55.660
There's no escape!

18
00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:57.790
Time to test your abilities!

19
00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:00.290
Show me what you've got,

20
00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:01.370
Hera!

21
00:01:02.380 --> 00:01:04.130
Okay, Mama!

22
00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:15.390
Fulgora!

23
00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:33.120
Extend your hand, no need to fear

24
00:01:33.330 --> 00:01:36.290
Cut through the wind, and persevere

25
00:01:36.620 --> 00:01:40.960
Chart your own course, the time to push forward is here

26
00:01:45.940 --> 00:01:49.260
In a time like a storm, hear the tidal waves roar,

27
00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:52.300
we keep trudging along but we're still wanting more

28
00:01:52.510 --> 00:01:55.810
But in spite of it all, the foundation we built

29
00:01:55.810 --> 00:01:58.430
for ourselves was about to fall

30
00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:02.310
Where the compass points - Is it right? Is it wrong?

31
00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:05.020
Who to ask? As if there's anyone listening

32
00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:08.360
I guess you'll never be one hundred percent sure

33
00:02:08.860 --> 00:02:11.820
But if you shut your eyes to the chaos,

34
00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:14.950
and you'd only take a breath

35
00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:18.250
When you open up your eyes

36
00:02:18.620 --> 00:02:21.960
you will find where you were meant to be

37
00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:25.380
Extend your hand, no need to fear

38
00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:28.590
Cut through the wind, and persevere

39
00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:33.470
Kick out the dark until the sky clears

40
00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:37.640
Even as we act in our own best interests,

41
00:02:37.810 --> 00:02:41.480
doing what we each believe is for our own

42
00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:46.270
Chart your own course, the time to push forward is here

43
00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:02.830
<b>The Sweet Bean Code</b>

44
00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:08.000
Killer...

45
00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:09.920
You there?

46
00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:13.340
Yeah...

47
00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:14.840
Dammit...

48
00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:16.800
She really knocked us into next week.

49
00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:18.260
Yeah...

50
00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:22.180
Alright, so... where are we?

51
00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:25.440
<b>Guest Parlor



Inside

the Castle</b>
Looks like we're back inside the castle...

52
00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:28.980
Where's Big Mom?

53
00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:30.650
She's not coming after us.

54
00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:32.610
Judging by the size of that hole,

55
00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:35.650
she probably lost track of
where she sent us.

56
00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:57.550
Kid!

57
00:03:58.180 --> 00:04:00.050
Where are you?!

58
00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:02.680
I'm gonna...

59
00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:05.770
slaughter you!

60
00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:13.360
Well, I guess she's down there.

61
00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:18.280
I'm not gonna let that old crone
team up with Kaido again!

62
00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:20.360
I'm sending her to hell!

63
00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:21.530
Let's hustle!

64
00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:34.880
Straw Sword!

65
00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:37.470
It's you...!

66
00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:42.300
Hawkins!

67
00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:44.470
<b>Basil Hawkins "the Magician" of the Worst Generation

Headliner, Beast Pirates</b>

68
00:04:47.770 --> 00:04:49.810
You son of a...

69
00:04:51.690 --> 00:04:55.110
You've got a lot of nerve to come attack us.

70
00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:57.190
You traitor!

71
00:04:57.190 --> 00:05:01.490
I was betrayed by Apoo, just like you.

72
00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:06.990
I merely avoided a fight
I knew I couldn't win.

73
00:05:07.330 --> 00:05:09.290
Smart move.

74
00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:11.870
No wonder you haven't made it big.

75
00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:15.630
If you're so weak that you know you'll lose,

76
00:05:16.630 --> 00:05:18.630
don't ever show your face...

77
00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:21.800
on the battlefield again!

78
00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:27.640
I'm impressed you're both still alive.

79
00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:30.100
Shut your trap already!

80
00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:33.520
Just breathing the same air as you
makes me wanna throw up!

81
00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:38.030
Kid, you go on ahead.

82
00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:47.910
We can't leave Big Mom unchecked.

83
00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:49.000
I'll...

84
00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:52.420
take care of him.

85
00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:57.590
Appreciate it.

86
00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:02.930
Kid's running away! After him!

87
00:06:08.810 --> 00:06:10.220
Many thanks.

88
00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:13.190
I didn't stand a chance two-on-one.

89
00:06:13.190 --> 00:06:14.900
Demon Face!

90
00:06:23.490 --> 00:06:29.120
You're doing a great job as
a Headliner for the Beast Pirates.

91
00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:31.700
You're totally domesticated.

92
00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:34.000
Say whatever you like.

93
00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:37.960
Your probability of
dying here is 92 percent.

94
00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:41.340
How pitiful, Kamazo the Reaper.

95
00:06:41.340 --> 00:06:43.590
Fortune-telling again?

96
00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:46.050
We take matters into our own hands.

97
00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:51.770
I wish you luck, Killer.

98
00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:05.360
Screw you.

99
00:07:05.910 --> 00:07:09.080
I don't want even one tiny bit...

100
00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:11.240
of your damn luck.

101
00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:17.830
You guys need to just...

102
00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.420
give it up already!

103
00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:23.970
The dino-dude jumped on!

104
00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:26.180
Go away!

105
00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:30.470
Usopp! Aim for his weak spots!

106
00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:31.760
I got this!

107
00:07:33.020 --> 00:07:36.600
We won't give up! We're not gonna die here!

108
00:07:37.190 --> 00:07:38.600
Temple!

109
00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:40.560
Chin!

110
00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:41.730
Adam's apple!

111
00:07:43.530 --> 00:07:44.740
You little...

112
00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:47.450
Leave us alone, you lousy lizard!

113
00:07:47.990 --> 00:07:49.280
Eyeball!

114
00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:51.700
Nostril!

115
00:07:56.290 --> 00:07:58.580
Just fall off already!

116
00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:00.880
How much do we have to hit you?!

117
00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:03.500
How the hell is he this tough?!

118
00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:09.970
You can do it, Komachiyo!

119
00:08:09.970 --> 00:08:11.300
We'll be there soon!

120
00:08:14.350 --> 00:08:16.850
If we can get to the Performance Floor stage,

121
00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:21.400
then the enemies that Horsella
and her friends fed the millet dumplings...

122
00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:24.730
will follow my orders too!

123
00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:28.280
And if they come to our side, then...

124
00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:30.870
my job here is done!

125
00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:33.370
If it means I can help everyone...

126
00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:36.160
then I don't care what happens to me!

127
00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:40.370
So get me to the stage!

128
00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:43.130
Don't be silly, Tama!

129
00:08:43.130 --> 00:08:44.800
Get a grip!

130
00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:48.420
This fight's not over till we take back Wano!

131
00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:52.600
Otama, keep your chin up!

132
00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:58.430
This young lady and old man
will protect you at all costs!

133
00:08:59.270 --> 00:09:02.060
Who are you calling an old man?!
I'm only nineteen!

134
00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:06.570
I wanted to help everyone...

135
00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:09.530
like Big Bro Luffy does.

136
00:09:09.530 --> 00:09:11.610
But I'm...

137
00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:16.290
I'm scared and can't take it anymore...

138
00:09:25.670 --> 00:09:27.170
You little runt!

139
00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:29.670
Don't push your luck!

140
00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:32.260
Can't you see the girl is scared?!

141
00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:36.600
I'm sorry, Tama.

142
00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:41.480
I won't let you worry anymore.

143
00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:44.940
Leave this to me!

144
00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:46.230
Usopp!

145
00:09:48.030 --> 00:09:50.400
Get ready, you lousy lizard!

146
00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:53.660
Long-nosed pest!

147
00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:58.120
Every little thing you do pisses me off!

148
00:09:58.120 --> 00:10:00.620
Lethal Green Star!

149
00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:05.210
What?!

150
00:10:05.210 --> 00:10:07.750
What are you doing,
you long-nosed freak?!

151
00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:09.840
Firework Flowers!

152
00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:21.810
Hot!

153
00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:23.230
Careful with that, Usopp!

154
00:10:23.230 --> 00:10:24.400
Sorry!

155
00:10:24.400 --> 00:10:26.770
I don't have many close-range weapons!

156
00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:29.320
But I'm gonna finish him off!

157
00:10:30.530 --> 00:10:33.450
Lethal Green Star!

158
00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:41.580
Exploding Pine Cones!

159
00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:56.180
Seriously, Usopp?!

160
00:10:56.180 --> 00:10:57.720
Boom!

161
00:10:57.720 --> 00:10:58.970
Direct hit!

162
00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:03.980
You like that, you freak?!

163
00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:06.480
Lizard extermination complete!

164
00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:14.820
You pest...

165
00:11:18.780 --> 00:11:20.990
You pest!

166
00:11:22.120 --> 00:11:24.080
He's back up!

167
00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:26.830
The dino fruit guys are insane!

168
00:11:32.550 --> 00:11:33.760
Dammit...

169
00:11:33.760 --> 00:11:37.180
That long-nosed pain-in-the-neck!

170
00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:40.260
If only a millet dumpling worked on him...!

171
00:11:40.680 --> 00:11:42.810
It only works on smile fruit eaters!

172
00:11:42.810 --> 00:11:45.140
What should we do if he comes back?!

173
00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:53.320
Get out here, Kid!

174
00:11:54.820 --> 00:11:56.740
– What?!
– What?!

175
00:11:56.740 --> 00:11:59.160
– Big Mom?!
– Big Mom?!

176
00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:02.490
<b>On the Roof</b>

177
00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:09.540
Huh? I'm free...

178
00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:10.710
Where's Mama?

179
00:12:10.710 --> 00:12:14.130
Mama! Where are you?!

180
00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:18.840
I'll be right there, Mama!

181
00:12:29.730 --> 00:12:31.480
Mama, where are you?!

182
00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:34.280
Say something! I'll be helpful!

183
00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:38.610
Looks like Eustass got weaker.

184
00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:41.320
Big Mom is back inside the castle...

185
00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:44.950
It won't be good if she
comes back for that thundercloud.

186
00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:52.420
Hey!

187
00:12:52.420 --> 00:12:55.050
I'm taking everyone but you!

188
00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:56.630
Got it!

189
00:12:56.630 --> 00:12:58.510
Mama!

190
00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:15.690
Seems like you're having fun.

191
00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:22.740
The worse things get, the more you smile.
And the bigger your smile...

192
00:13:54.860 --> 00:13:56.520
Luffy!

193
00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:59.320
Please! Defeat him!

194
00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:05.160
Kaido!

195
00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:10.620
<b>Connecting Hallway

From Treasury 2F to Castle 3F</b>

196
00:14:24.680 --> 00:14:27.050
Kiku, does your arm hurt?

197
00:14:28.640 --> 00:14:30.850
You needn't ask that of a samurai.

198
00:14:31.310 --> 00:14:33.770
Until my life is extinguished,
it's merely an itch.

199
00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:38.940
Just the way my heart itched
on the day you disappeared.

200
00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:45.240
Big Brother!

201
00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:46.910
Hey...

202
00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:50.620
If you can still tease me,
you must be well enough.

203
00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:54.210
My deepest apologies
for leaving without a word.

204
00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:55.830
Izo.

205
00:14:56.420 --> 00:14:58.750
If Wano is opened successfully,

206
00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:00.710
how do you think it may change?

207
00:15:01.340 --> 00:15:02.550
Well...

208
00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:06.800
If we survive, let us
talk of this tomorrow morning.

209
00:15:08.680 --> 00:15:09.930
A rather tall task!

210
00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:14.520
This is all-out war! Either we win, or we die!

211
00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:17.400
Their forces are surely spread thin.

212
00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:21.690
I can protect Lord Momonosuke on my own!

213
00:15:22.280 --> 00:15:24.900
Kanjuro is after Lord Momonosuke's life!

214
00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:28.910
I will attempt to reach
Lord Momonosuke before he does,

215
00:15:28.910 --> 00:15:31.490
and vanquish him myself!

216
00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:34.120
The rest of you, help everyone you can!

217
00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:35.290
Understood.

218
00:15:35.290 --> 00:15:37.830
Okay, Kin'emon.

219
00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:41.040
Cat, let us spread out!

220
00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:44.170
You got it!

221
00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:46.630
Best of luck!

222
00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:51.930
Sir Kin!

223
00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:56.100
Please allow me to vanquish Kanjuro!

224
00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:57.480
I won't fail this time!

225
00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:01.900
Kiku!

226
00:16:01.900 --> 00:16:03.730
Follow me!

227
00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:04.940
Okay!

228
00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:09.110
That's...!

229
00:16:10.490 --> 00:16:12.370
Master Nekomamushi!

230
00:16:12.370 --> 00:16:14.370
I knew it was you!

231
00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:17.790
Shishilian! Bariete!

232
00:16:17.710 --> 00:16:19.750
<b>Captain of Inuarashi's Musketeers</b>

233
00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:19.750
<b>Mink Recon Squad</b>

234
00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:19.750
<b>Bariete</b>
<b>Shishilian</b>

235
00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:21.880
Where are you dashing off to?!

236
00:16:21.880 --> 00:16:24.170
We require your assistance!

237
00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:27.550
You see, Pedro is...

238
00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:37.180
Pedro...

239
00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:39.270
is dead?!

240
00:16:39.270 --> 00:16:42.520
Yes. He died in Big Mom's territory.

241
00:16:42.900 --> 00:16:48.030
Were it not for him, I doubt
Luffy's crew would be here now!

242
00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:51.740
I see.

243
00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:53.120
Pedro...

244
00:16:53.120 --> 00:16:55.740
Mew've done well.

245
00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:58.660
And the man responsible
for his death is on this island?!

246
00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:02.250
Yes, and we need your help!

247
00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:07.090
It would seem Wanda and Carrot
are currently doing battle with him!

248
00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:10.930
I was always gonna help you!

249
00:17:19.020 --> 00:17:22.650
Master!

250
00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:27.690
That cat is flying!

251
00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:35.580
<b>Crawl Space


First Floor

Inside the Castle</b>

252
00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:37.240
Momonosuke.

253
00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:38.450
Shinobu.

254
00:17:38.450 --> 00:17:40.040
Watch out for the Marys!

255
00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:44.500
They're roaming around
Onigashima to do recon!

256
00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:47.340
What? Where?! Where are they?!

257
00:17:47.340 --> 00:17:49.970
Worry not! We have this!

258
00:17:51.220 --> 00:17:52.510
It's you!

259
00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:53.890
I thought so!

260
00:17:53.890 --> 00:17:57.560
I'll use this to make myself a decoy!

261
00:17:57.560 --> 00:18:00.730
You and I are being targeted as a pair.

262
00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:03.480
So I'm gonna carry this and run for it!

263
00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:04.980
Let's do this!

264
00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:09.860
It is clear that you simply wish to fight.

265
00:18:09.860 --> 00:18:11.280
Go ahead, Yamato.

266
00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:14.990
We're in contact with Sir Kin!

267
00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:17.780
I shall stay here and protect
Lord Momonosuke!

268
00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:21.080
Mm-hm. I appreciate it, Shinobu!

269
00:18:25.790 --> 00:18:26.960
Oh, right!

270
00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:29.380
Momonosuke,

271
00:18:29.380 --> 00:18:32.130
you can hear Luffy's voice, right?

272
00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:32.920
Is he okay?

273
00:18:34.680 --> 00:18:36.760
Mm-hm, I can hear it.

274
00:18:37.430 --> 00:18:39.810
It is the same as before.

275
00:18:39.810 --> 00:18:41.810
He is weaker, but still well.

276
00:18:41.810 --> 00:18:43.020
But...

277
00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:46.900
there are now only two voices!

278
00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:54.240
A duel...

279
00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:57.620
Luffy and Kaido
must be fighting head-to-head!

280
00:18:57.620 --> 00:18:58.910
I need to hurry!

281
00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:08.250
Oden's Travel Record

282
00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:10.250
I see...

283
00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:12.670
Everything regarding my father's adventures...

284
00:19:13.800 --> 00:19:17.010
I had heard so many stories about him...

285
00:19:17.640 --> 00:19:20.100
but to see them written out like this...

286
00:19:28.150 --> 00:19:29.440
Why...?!

287
00:19:29.940 --> 00:19:32.070
It's you two!

288
00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:36.780
The Cat Burglar and the long-nosed one...

289
00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:41.790
– She's gonna kill us!
– She's gonna kill us!

290
00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:44.750
You're Straw Hat's crewmates.

291
00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:47.580
Olin!

292
00:19:50.170 --> 00:19:51.460
Otama!

293
00:19:54.090 --> 00:19:56.340
Hello there, Otama!

294
00:19:56.760 --> 00:20:01.430
What in the world are you doing
in such a dangerous place?

295
00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:04.020
I've been worried about you, Olin!

296
00:20:04.430 --> 00:20:06.440
You suddenly disappeared in Udon!

297
00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:11.730
I'm sorry.

298
00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:15.610
But I've worried so much about you, too!

299
00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:19.870
I'm not mad! I'm happy to see you again!

300
00:20:19.870 --> 00:20:25.660
Great! Thank you so much for
taking care of me when I lost my memory!

301
00:20:26.410 --> 00:20:29.880
Oh, good! You got it back!

302
00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:31.710
Mm-hm!

303
00:20:32.090 --> 00:20:34.050
Crap...

304
00:20:34.050 --> 00:20:39.090
Mama's gone into mother mode!
That only happens around kids ten and under!

305
00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:42.800
H-H-Hold on, Otama!

306
00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:44.890
I-Is she your friend?!

307
00:20:45.270 --> 00:20:47.390
You look so pretty in a kimono!

308
00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:49.060
You really think so?!

309
00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:52.270
I got a new hairpin!

310
00:20:52.690 --> 00:20:56.150
Otama! Get her out of here!

311
00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:59.490
Hey, the person who did my hair...

312
00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:07.000
You know, that poor busybody
from Okobore Town...

313
00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:09.580
Oh, Otsuru!

314
00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:11.040
How is she doing?

315
00:21:13.340 --> 00:21:18.090
I may have only had a little,
but I'll never forget the taste of that oshiruko!

316
00:21:18.090 --> 00:21:19.720
It was so delicious!

317
00:21:20.090 --> 00:21:22.050
I wish I could eat it again.

318
00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:25.220
Actually, Olin...

319
00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:29.350
Okobore Town...

320
00:21:29.350 --> 00:21:31.940
is gone now.

321
00:21:32.350 --> 00:21:35.320
Gone? What do you mean, "gone"?

322
00:21:35.320 --> 00:21:39.360
The samurai are the ones who ate
all the food before the raid,

323
00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:42.490
but it ended up getting
pinned on the townsfolk.

324
00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:46.870
And then Kaido's followers...

325
00:21:46.870 --> 00:21:49.750
burned the town to the ground!

326
00:21:50.290 --> 00:21:51.120
What?

327
00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:53.080
Olin.

328
00:21:56.630 --> 00:21:58.300
So good!

329
00:21:58.630 --> 00:22:00.840
It's yummy!

330
00:22:03.760 --> 00:22:05.850
They're rebels!

331
00:22:05.850 --> 00:22:07.390
Don't let 'em get away!

332
00:22:07.810 --> 00:22:11.270
Light 'em up! And their houses, too!

333
00:22:13.190 --> 00:22:15.230
The people of Okobore Town were...

334
00:22:16.440 --> 00:22:18.190
Otsuru!

335
00:22:19.150 --> 00:22:22.700
My, you look simply stunning, Olin!

336
00:22:22.700 --> 00:22:24.070
You think so?

337
00:22:24.070 --> 00:22:25.660
You look super cute!

338
00:22:27.620 --> 00:22:30.080
Kaido's subservient freaks...!

339
00:22:30.080 --> 00:22:32.410
Destroy this town and its people!

340
00:22:32.410 --> 00:22:35.380
Burn it to the ground!

341
00:22:46.640 --> 00:22:51.680
The people who helped me
when I lost my memory...

342
00:22:53.600 --> 00:22:55.060
Olin!

343
00:23:00.400 --> 00:23:02.280
Everyone...

344
00:23:04.030 --> 00:23:09.120
Everyone in Okobore Town
who treated me with such kindness...

345
00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:15.120
You're telling me they destroyed it?!

346
00:23:16.710 --> 00:23:20.000
The dino-dude is coming!

347
00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:22.880
Go away! We're busy with something!

348
00:23:22.880 --> 00:23:24.760
Book it, Komachiyo!

349
00:23:24.760 --> 00:23:27.140
Hey, Big Mom!

350
00:23:27.140 --> 00:23:30.060
Don't let them past you!

351
00:23:33.480 --> 00:23:35.560
Go, Komachiyo!

352
00:23:40.860 --> 00:23:44.570
Too late! It's over for you!

353
00:23:52.870 --> 00:23:54.870
You bunch of brutes...

354
00:23:59.580 --> 00:24:03.170
Even in the cruel world of pirates,

355
00:24:03.590 --> 00:24:06.550
there's still a code of honor!

356
00:24:19.020 --> 00:24:21.020
Damn you!

357
00:24:21.020 --> 00:24:23.780
You clowns!

358
00:24:30.620 --> 00:24:32.870
Over there?! Big Mom!

359
00:24:33.990 --> 00:24:35.290
It's Mama!

360
00:24:35.290 --> 00:24:37.790
I'm so glad she's alive!

361
00:24:39.000 --> 00:24:40.830
Are you okay, Komachiyo?!

362
00:24:40.830 --> 00:24:42.750
Hang in there!
